(40, 'Farzan Hussain', NULL, 'Collaboration Inquiry', 'Hi,														\r\n														\r\nI am Farzan, the Business Development Manager at John Academy, a reputable provider of online courses. We offer over 2500 globally recognised courses and have eight years of experience in the Ed-Tech sector.														\r\n														\r\nWould you be interested in reselling these courses under your own branding and pricing? We can create a customised LMS for you, allowing you to sell courses directly under your own pricing and branding.														\r\n														\r\nIf you are interested in learning more about our courses and exploring potential collaboration opportunities, I would be happy to schedule a meeting at your convenience.														\r\n														\r\nFor further details about us, please visit John Academy.														\r\n														\r\nWarm regards,														\r\nFarzan Hussain', 0, NULL, '02039233962', '2024-11-20 13:44:15', '2024-11-20 13:44:15'),
